BLOG+=[
('how-to-make-wedding-album-in-photoshop','How to Make a Wedding Album in Photoshop: Complete Beginner Workflow',['Making a wedding album in Photoshop is a repeatable process: plan, select photos, lay out spreads, polish and export. Once you follow the same steps every time, a 30-spread album becomes a two-day job instead of a two-week one.','Start with the album size your lab prints, such as 12x36. Create or open a template at the right pixel size: 10800x3600 px at 300 DPI or 5400x1800 px at 150 DPI.','Sort the photos into events in story order. Pick one hero image per spread first, then two to four supporting shots.','Use a layered template. Place each photo above its frame layer and clip it with Alt+Ctrl+G. Resize with Ctrl+T and keep faces away from the centre fold.','Unify colour with a single Curves or Color Lookup adjustment group so every spread looks like it belongs to the same book.','Proof each spread at 100%, fix spelling, flatten a copy to JPG for the lab and archive the PSDs.']),
('marriage-album-photo-size-guide','Marriage Album Photo Size Guide: Common Sizes Explained',['Indian studios commonly print marriage albums as 12x36, 12x30, 12x24, 12x18 and 18x24 spreads. The first number is the height and the second is the open spread width.','12x36 is the most popular panoramic size and suits cinematic layouts. 12x30 is slightly narrower and often cheaper to print.','12x18 and 12x24 are compact sizes used for parent albums and pre-wedding books. 18x24 is a large premium format.','Always match the template to the size you order. Resizing a 12x36 design to 12x30 changes the proportions and can crop important elements.','For sharp prints, keep 200 to 300 DPI at the final size and check every photo at 100% zoom.']),
('karizma-album-printing-cost-factors','What Affects Karizma Album Printing Cost? A Studio Guide',['Karizma album prices vary widely between labs and cities, so instead of quoting numbers that go out of date, here are the factors that actually change the cost.','Sheet size: larger spreads such as 12x36 and 18x24 use more paper than 12x18.','Number of sheets: most labs price per sheet, so a 40-sheet album costs far more than a 20-sheet one.','Paper and finish: matte, glossy, metallic and textured papers have different prices, as do lamination options.','Cover type: leather, acrylic, wooden and printed covers vary a lot. Ask your lab for a written price list and compare total cost per album, not just per sheet.']),
('album-cover-dimensions','Album Cover Dimensions for Wedding Albums',['An album cover is usually printed at the page size of the album plus wrap and bleed, which depends on the cover type and binding.','For a 12x36 album, the closed book is 12x18, so many cover designs are prepared at 12x18 or as a full wrap including the spine.','Ask your lab for its exact cover template, because spine width depends on the number of sheets.','Keep text and faces inside the safe area, well away from the wrap edges.','Use a strong single portrait and simple typography; covers with too many photos look cluttered when printed.']),
('how-to-change-studio-background-in-photoshop','How to Change a Studio Background in Photoshop',['Open the portrait and use Select > Subject to create a quick selection of the person.','Refine the edges with Select and Mask, paying attention to hair. Output the result as a layer mask.','Place a studio background PSD below the portrait layer and scale it to fit.','Match lighting by adding a soft shadow on a new layer under the subject and adjusting the background brightness.','Finish with a Color Lookup or Curves adjustment above both layers so the subject and background share the same tone.']),
('does-photoshop-have-album-templates','Does Photoshop Have Album Templates? Where to Find Them',['Photoshop includes a few generic document presets but no ready-made Indian wedding album templates in the 12x36 or 12x30 formats studios use.','Album designers use layered PSD templates from libraries like PSD Album, which are made for these print sizes.','A good template has clipping masks for photos, grouped decorations and editable text.','Always check the DPI and pixel dimensions before using a template for print.','Save your edited templates as a personal library so you can reuse your favourite layouts.']),
('album-design-software-options','Album Design Software: Photoshop vs Dedicated Album Tools',['Photoshop is the most flexible option for album design because it gives full control over every layer, mask and colour.','Dedicated album design tools automate layout and photo placement, which is faster for high-volume studios but less flexible.','Many studios combine both: automated tools for quick drafts and Photoshop with PSD templates for premium albums.','Whatever software you use, keep the print size, DPI and colour profile consistent with your lab.','Free PSD templates are a practical way to get professional layouts without paying for an extra tool.']),
('wedding-album-design-ideas','25 Wedding Album Design Ideas for Modern Studios',['Open with a full-bleed couple portrait to set the tone.','Use a detail spread for rings, jewellery, mehndi and decor.','Give each ritual its own spread with one hero photo.','Use a minimal white layout for candid moments.','Close with a family group spread and a final couple portrait.','Mix full-bleed images with framed layouts so the album has rhythm.']),
('what-is-dm-album-psd','What Is a DM Album PSD? Meaning for Album Designers',['In Indian studio circles, "DM album PSD" usually refers to ready-made album sheets: full spreads with frames, ornaments and text already designed.','They are typically sold or shared in 12x36 size and opened in Photoshop.','You replace the sample photos using clipping masks and edit names and dates.','DM sheets save time for high-volume studios that deliver many albums each month.','Browse our 12x36 DM album PSD collection to try ready sheets for free.']),
('12x36-vs-14x40-album','12x36 vs 14x40 Album Size: Which Is Better?',['12x36 is the most widely printed panoramic album size and most templates are made for it.','14x40 is a larger premium size with more space per spread, but fewer templates are available and printing usually costs more.','Converting a 12x36 template to 14x40 changes proportions, so expect to adjust layouts.','For most clients, 12x36 offers the best balance of impact, cost and template choice.','Ask your lab which sizes it prints and compare samples before deciding.']),
('how-many-photos-in-a-wedding-album','How Many Photos Should a Wedding Album Have?',['There is no fixed rule, but most studios aim for two to six photos per spread.','A 30-spread album with three to four photos per spread holds roughly 90 to 120 images.','Quality matters more than quantity: one strong hero image per spread looks more premium than crowded pages.','Let the client pick favourites, then you choose supporting photos for flow.','Keep extra photos for a parent album or digital gallery.']),
('tamil-wedding-album-page-order','Tamil Wedding Album Page Order: A Practical Sequence',['A clear page order makes a Tamil wedding album easy to follow.','Start with preparations and the Nichayathartham or engagement.','Follow with Kashi Yatra, Oonjal, Kanyadaanam and Muhurtham.','Add Saptapadi and blessings from elders, then family group photos.','Finish with the reception and a final couple spread. Browse our Tamil wedding album PSD collection for matching layouts.']),
('kerala-wedding-album-design-ideas','Kerala Wedding Album Design Ideas',['Kerala weddings often call for elegant, minimal layouts with plenty of white space.','Kasavu whites and golds pair well with soft floral accents.','Give the thali-tying moment and family blessings their own spreads.','Use large portraits of the couple in natural light.','Keep fonts simple and classic for a timeless finish.']),
('telugu-wedding-album-design-ideas','Telugu Wedding Album Design Ideas',['Telugu weddings are colourful, so bold royal layouts work well.','Plan spreads for Pellikoothuru, Mangala Snanam, Jeelakarra Bellam and Talambralu.','Use golden ornaments and rich maroon backgrounds for ritual pages.','Balance busy ritual spreads with clean portrait pages.','Close with the reception and a family spread.']),
('baby-shower-album-ideas','Baby Shower Album Design Ideas',['Baby shower albums suit soft pastels and gentle illustrations.','Include the decorations, rituals and family blessings.','Use a portrait spread of the parents-to-be as the centrepiece.','Add space for short notes or dates.','Match the style with the later newborn album for continuity.']),
('newborn-baby-album-design-tips','Newborn Baby Album Design Tips',['Keep layouts calm with lots of white space.','Use close-ups of tiny details like hands and feet.','Plan pages by week or month for a growth story.','Choose soft fonts and muted colours.','Print on matte paper for a gentle look.']),
('studio-background-setup-tips','Studio Background Setup Tips for Small Photo Studios',['A plain, evenly lit backdrop makes it easy to replace backgrounds digitally later.','Keep the subject a metre or more away from the backdrop to reduce shadows.','Use soft, diffused light to avoid hard edges that are difficult to cut out.','Shoot in RAW for maximum flexibility when changing backgrounds.','Combine your shots with studio background PSDs for creative variety.']),
('album-design-freelance-guide','How to Get Album Design Freelance Work',['Build a portfolio of 10 to 20 polished spreads using free templates and sample photos.','Offer your services to local studios that are overloaded during the wedding season.','Set clear pricing per spread and a fixed turnaround time.','Communicate with simple proof links and handle corrections quickly.','Keep learning new layout trends to stay competitive.']),
('best-paper-for-wedding-albums','Choosing Paper Finishes for Wedding Albums',['Matte paper reduces glare and suits soft, pastel albums.','Glossy paper makes colours pop but shows fingerprints.','Metallic and pearl papers add shine to golden themes.','Textured papers suit fine-art and minimal designs.','Ask your lab for sample sheets before choosing.']),
('how-to-fix-zip-extraction-errors','How to Fix ZIP Extraction Errors When Downloading PSDs',['If a ZIP will not open, first make sure the download finished completely; partial downloads cause most errors.','Use 7-Zip or the latest WinRAR, which handle large archives better than older tools.','Files on PSD Album have no password, so you should never be asked for one.','If Google Drive shows a virus-scan warning for large files, choose "Download anyway".','If problems continue, try downloading again on a different browser or network.']),
('wedding-album-layout-rules','10 Wedding Album Layout Rules Professionals Follow',['Never place faces on the centre fold.','Keep consistent margins on all spreads.','Use one hero photo per spread.','Limit fonts to two families.','Align frames to a simple grid.','Balance colour and visual weight across the spread.']),
('photo-book-vs-karizma-album','Photo Book vs Karizma Album: What Is the Difference?',['A photo book is usually printed on thinner pages with standard binding, while a Karizma album uses thick, photo-printed flush-mount sheets.','Karizma albums lie flat when opened, which makes panoramic spreads look seamless.','Photo books are lighter and cheaper, good for parent albums and gifts.','Karizma albums feel more premium and last longer.','Both use the same PSD templates if the size matches.']),
('how-many-pages-in-a-wedding-album','How Many Pages Should a Wedding Album Have?',['Most wedding albums have 20 to 40 spreads, depending on the number of events and budget.','A single-day wedding usually fits in 20 to 30 spreads.','Multi-day Indian weddings often need 35 to 50 spreads or two volumes.','Plan the number of spreads per event before designing.','Remember that more pages increase printing cost, so agree with the client in advance.']),
('using-ai-in-album-design','Using AI Tools in Album Design: What Works Today',['AI tools can help with culling, colour matching and quick photo selection.','Photoshop features like Select Subject and Generative Fill speed up cut-outs and cleanups.','AI cannot replace story planning and taste, which make an album special.','Use AI for repetitive work and keep creative layout decisions in your hands.','Combine AI-assisted editing with layered PSD templates for the fastest workflow.']),
('wedding-album-colour-themes','Choosing a Colour Theme for a Wedding Album',['Start from the couple’s outfits and venue décor.','Pick one main colour and one accent colour.','Maroon and gold suit traditional ceremonies; ivory and pastel suit receptions and pre-wedding shoots.','Use backgrounds and ornaments from the same palette throughout.','Check colours on a calibrated monitor before printing.']),
]
